10     *                           Description : This programs object is to
11     * prevent duplicate vendor code entries with disciplined data . The
12     * steps are to search for Vendors, if not there create a request by
13     * users. This request has to be released b4 it can be assigned in the
14     * system through MM01 BDC. Mail is triggered on the status of the req
15     * to the user who has created the request. Extension is an extension
16     * from PMAT to PSRV or POBV Purchasing Orgn.
17     *---------------------------------------------------------------------*
