7523   * message & make deletion flag blank
7524   *----------------------------------------------------------------------*
7525   *  -->  p_tr_mode Transaction mode i.e. Create/Change/Display/Delete
7526   *----------------------------------------------------------------------*
7527   FORM chk_unbl_del_flg USING p_tr_mode.
